                    contextlib imports it, and vendoring one without the
                    other is an ImportError)

The sibling datetime/, itertools/, operator/, shutil/ and tempfile/ directories
hold an upstream _core.py under this same licence, with femm-qt's own additions
in an __init__.py beside it. Each carries its own copy of this notice, so that
any one of those directories travels complete -- which is the point of keeping
the notice in a file rather than in a header: it lets _core.py stay byte-
identical to upstream, so re-vendoring is a plain copy and `diff` stays empty.

